# Frozen pilot summaries document availability, timing and the cost estimate.
# Raw rows/spectra, smoke and failed attempts remain local.
*
!.gitignore
!pilot/
pilot/*
!pilot/summary.csv
!pilot/metadata.csv
!pilot/cells.csv
!pilot/timing.csv
!pilot/cost.csv
!pilot/failures.csv
# Registered production (Modal, 2026-10-05): summaries, compact failure counts
# and provenance. Raw rows, spectra and per-draw failures stay on the volume.
!production-2026-10-05/
production-2026-10-05/*
!production-2026-10-05/summary.csv
!production-2026-10-05/cells.csv
!production-2026-10-05/metadata.csv
!production-2026-10-05/timing.csv
!production-2026-10-05/cost.csv
!production-2026-10-05/failure_counts.csv
# Fresh-draw All confirmation (cells on Modal, combined locally 2026-10-05).
!confirm-2026-10-05/
confirm-2026-10-05/*
!confirm-2026-10-05/summary.csv
!confirm-2026-10-05/cells.csv
!confirm-2026-10-05/metadata.csv
!confirm-2026-10-05/timing.csv
!confirm-2026-10-05/cost.csv
!confirm-2026-10-05/failure_counts.csv
